  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version: VRChat 2021.4.2p3, build 1162\n\nDescription of the bug: Even though everyone in a friends+ world was on \"Ask me\" status, a friend of a friend was able to join through using the world menu and selecting the instance directly\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): Set status to \"Ask me\", create a new Friends+ or Friends world. Have a friend select the world you're in from the world menu and join via the instance picker. This bypasses the \"Ask me\" status\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): N/A",
